    "Scope covers three existing source owners and their affected mappings; root alone publishes source/Git. Preserve full Original facts and historical claims. Do not infer capacities, original spelling/TU boundaries, callback pointee type/lifetime or acceptance. Full build/link, matching/reference checks, independent review and relevant host controls precede manual integration. No flags, wrappers, raw executable pointers, code-copying or unsafe-path fixes.",
    "Native outside residuals for intentionally changed literal storage remain explicit; never convert data/symbol changes to a pass by waiving them. No handtyped Original/ByteExact tokens. All Object facts pass through native object writer and guarded publication."
  ],
